---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import TerminalFrame from '../../components/TerminalFrame.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | The Root Cause" description="Privacy policy for The Root Cause uploader.">
  <main class="wide">
    <TerminalFrame path="the-root-cause | privacy">
      <p class="line">
        <span class="prompt-user">the-root-cause</span><span class="prompt-sep">:~$ </span>
        <span class="cmd">cat privacy.md</span>
      </p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Effective date: October 14, 2026</p>

      <p>This policy covers <strong>The Root Cause uploader</strong>, an application used to manage the YouTube channel for The Root Cause, and this website.</p>

      <h2>What the app does</h2>
      <p>The app uses the YouTube Data API solely to upload and schedule videos to the YouTube channel owned by the operator. It does not access, read, or act on any other channel or account.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>The app collects no data from viewers or other users. This website uses GoatCounter, a privacy-focused analytics service, to count page views and clicks on outbound links. GoatCounter does not use cookies, does not track visitors across other sites, and does not collect any personally identifying information.</p>

      <h2>How access tokens are stored</h2>
      <p>OAuth tokens issued by Google are stored only on the operator's private server. They are never shared, sold, or transmitted to any third party.</p>

      <h2>Google API Services User Data Policy</h2>
      <p>The Root Cause uploader's use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" rel="noopener">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:therootcausehq@gmail.com">therootcausehq@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <p class="line back">
        <span class="prompt-user">the-root-cause</span><span class="prompt-sep">:~$ </span>
        <a class="cmd-link" href="/">cd ..</a>
      </p>
    </TerminalFrame>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter showPrivacyLink={false} />
</BaseLayout>
